d unnecessary SVG elements in it, such as a group and a clip path.\r\n\r\nThis PR simplifies and optimizes the image, taking it from 584 bytes to 358 bytes, 38.7% smaller. The new SVG produces identical results when rendered.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nNo AI was used at all. I used a combination of [GodSVG](https://godsvg.com/) and [svgcleaner](https://github.com/razrfalcon/svgcleaner).\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nFootnote: While making this, I also considered changing the amount of rays from 8 to 12, to make it look less like the DirectionalLight3D icon. However... it just kinda looks like a circuit board. So the file included in this PR does not change the appearance at all, it just optimizes it. If anyone wants the circuit board version, here it is:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"AreaLight3D-circuitboard\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9ebbfa74-aa62-404d-9c24-7fc0a0aad29f\" />\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","fo